{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35702","headline":"巫山高 · 李咸用","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"通蜀连秦山十二，中有妖灵会人意。\n鬬艳传情世不知，楚王魂梦春风里。\n雨态云容多似是，色荒见物皆成媚。\n露泫烟愁岩上花，至今犹滴相思泪。\n西眉南脸人中美，或者皆闻无所利。\n忍听凭虚巧佞言，不求万寿翻求死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}